// spec/engine/worldClock.md, "Story: Advance the world clock without blocking on inference"; spec/engine/worldClock.md, "Story: Schedule core world jobs and exclude retired routes"; spec/engine/worldClock.md, "Story: Guard perpetual funding cutover across 8-hour UTC periods"; spec/engine/index.md, "Story: Run non-blocking minute ticks and D-25 bounded NPC loops"
